          <p class="bt-p">Every credit card transaction occurs within a secure environment. The iMosaicArt payment system uses <strong>128-bit SSL security encryption</strong> — you'll see a padlock icon in your browser confirming the connection is secure.</p>
          <div class="bt-note">
